      "id": "9c994805eaa4-q5",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "In 1928,who discovered that when a ray of coloured light enters a liquid, a fraction of the light scattered by that liquid is of a different colour? 1928 &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;, &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2344;&#2375; &#2351;&#2361; &#2326;&#2379;&#2332; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2368; &#2332;&#2348; &#2352;&#2306;&#2327;&#2368;&#2344; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2358; &#2325;&#2368; &#2319;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2342;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2313;&#2360; &#2342;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2368;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339;&#2367;&#2340; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2358; &#2325;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2309;&#2306;&#2358; &#2319;&#2325; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2352;&#2306;&#2327; &#2325;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>In 1928,who discovered that when a ray of coloured light enters a liquid, a fraction of the light scattered by that liquid is of a different colour?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>1928 &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;, &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2344;&#2375; &#2351;&#2361; &#2326;&#2379;&#2332; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2368; &#2332;&#2348; &#2352;&#2306;&#2327;&#2368;&#2344; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2358; &#2325;&#2368; &#2319;&#2325; &#2325;&#2367;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2342;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2313;&#2360; &#2342;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2368;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339;&#2367;&#2340; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2358; &#2325;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2309;&#2306;&#2358; &#2319;&#2325; &#2349;&#2367;&#2344;&#2381;&#2344; &#2352;&#2306;&#2327; &#2325;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
