          "id": "D",
          "text": "Edmund Halley &#2319;&#2337;&#2350;&#2306;&#2337; &#2361;&#2376;&#2354;&#2368;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Edmund Halley</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2319;&#2337;&#2350;&#2306;&#2337; &#2361;&#2376;&#2354;&#2368;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>Philosophiae Naturalis Principia Mathematica, popularly known as Principia, published in 1687, is the great work of <b>Sir. Isaac Newton.</b></p>",
