      "question": "In which year did Hans Christian Oersted discover that a compass needle gets deflected when an electric current passes through a metallic wire placed nearby? &#2361;&#2306;&#2360; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2351;&#2344; &#2323;&#2352;&#2381;&#2360;&#2381;&#2335;&#2375;&#2337; &#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2351;&#2361; &#2326;&#2379;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2341;&#2368; &#2325;&#2367; &#2332;&#2348; &#2357;&#2367;&#2342;&#2381;&#2351;&#2369;&#2340; &#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2346;&#2366;&#2360; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2352;&#2326;&#2375; &#2343;&#2366;&#2340;&#2369; &#2325;&#2375; &#2340;&#2366;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2327;&#2369;&#2332;&#2352;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376; &#2340;&#2379; &#2325;&#2350;&#2381;&#2346;&#2366;&#2360; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2369;&#2312; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2375;&#2346;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>In which year did Hans Christian Oersted discover that a compass needle gets deflected when an electric current passes through a metallic wire placed nearby?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2361;&#2306;&#2360; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2351;&#2344; &#2323;&#2352;&#2381;&#2360;&#2381;&#2335;&#2375;&#2337; &#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2351;&#2361; &#2326;&#2379;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2341;&#2368; &#2325;&#2367; &#2332;&#2348; &#2357;&#2367;&#2342;&#2381;&#2351;&#2369;&#2340; &#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2346;&#2366;&#2360; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2352;&#2326;&#2375; &#2343;&#2366;&#2340;&#2369; &#2325;&#2375; &#2340;&#2366;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2327;&#2369;&#2332;&#2352;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376; &#2340;&#2379; &#2325;&#2350;&#2381;&#2346;&#2366;&#2360; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2369;&#2312; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2375;&#2346;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "1826 1826",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1826</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1826</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "1824 1824",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1824</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1824</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "1820 1820",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1820</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1820</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "1822 1822",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">1822</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1822</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>In 1820, Hans Christian Oersted, a Danish physicist, discovered the relationship between electricity and magnetism. He observed that a compass needle placed near a current-carrying wire gets deflected, proving that electric current produces a magnetic field. This discovery led to the development of electromagnetism.</p>",
